# Rename screenshots on the Desktop to short kebab-case names based on their content
function screenshots() {
  claw "
    Look at screenshot files matching ~/Desktop/Screenshot*.png only.
    Do NOT recurse into any subdirectories on the Desktop.
    Do NOT rename or touch any files outside ~/Desktop.
    For each matching file, read the image, determine what it shows,
    and rename it to a short descriptive kebab-case name
    (e.g. slack-thread-api-error.png, vscode-diff-view.png).
    Keep names under 5 words.
    Only rename files that still have the default Screenshot naming pattern.
    Print a summary of old name -> new name for each file renamed.
  "
}
